           
              Other Doors Availiable From Hannibal Lecter Are:

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.  ShowDoors V1.0      - Displays All Doors To Users, Works With /X2.x-3.x
--------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
2.  ReportUser V1.0     - Tells The SysOp With "Say" That A User Has Logged
                          On, Different For Each Status Level.
                          Works With /X2.x-3.x
--------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
3.  UserInfo V2.2       - A Very Informative User Status Door For /X2.x-3.x
--------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
4.  FuckOff V1.0        - A Nice Logoff door with functions like, message
                          to next caller, download of latest board add..
                          Works with /X2.x-3.x
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
5.  Operate V1.0        - A Nice operator door. If the sysop ain't
                          availiable then you can leave him a message.
                          Works with /X2.x-3.x
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
6.  SystemHandler V1.0  - A good replacement for the sysopcommands, good
                          for "not so good" cosysops. Works with /X2.x-3.x
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
7.  SysOpAvail V1.0     - A 'FrontEnd' door thats tells the user if the
                          sysop is availiable for chat or not. Works With
                          /X2.x-3.x
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
8.  TransferChecker V1.0- A little unnessesary door that displays UL&DL's
                          And gives the user a comment based on the info.
                          Works with /X2.x-3.x
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

                   And More Doors Developed Each Day..
